<title>USA: Dayton Hudson sets $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Dayton Hudson sets $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Friday, said lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER DAYTON HUDSON CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.80 PCT   MATURITY 10/01/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA1    SPREAD +54 BP     PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  YIELD 6.80 PCT    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
